{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_01",
      "hash": "40fdab8e6795129d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好，\\n兒童的參觀費是₽50。\\r\\n要參觀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_02",
      "hash": "40fda88e67950d84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "下次再來喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_03",
      "hash": "40fda98e67950f37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好的，\\n收[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳₽50！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_04",
      "hash": "40fda68e67950a1e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的錢不夠呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_05",
      "hash": "40fda78e67950bd1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請慢慢參觀！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_06",
      "hash": "40fda48e679506b8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "居然想要從後門免費入場，\\n真會貪小便宜。\\c\\n話說回來，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道什麼是琥珀嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_07",
      "hash": "40fda58e6795086b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "據說有一間研究所正在\\n進行一個大實驗。\\c\\n他們似乎想要讓\\n藏在琥珀中的遠古生物復活過來。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t003r0101_scientist_01_08",
      "hash": "40fda28e67950352",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "琥珀就是那些由很久很久以前\\n流出來的樹汁凝固而成\\c\\n像化石一樣的東西。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_033_max",
      "hash": "39c45feef4e720a4"
    }
  ]
}
